#plain_title("Part III", "Answers")

#dropcap("E")very answer here was run, and each screen is what Bund printed.
Where a problem has more than one good answer, this is one of them. A word
defined in an earlier answer is used in later ones without being shown again;
`rem`, `over` and `pair` are the ones that travel furthest.

The words are short on purpose. A definition must fit on one line of the
terminal, and a word that will not fit is better as two.
